# AEKO Explorer Web has no endpoint-specific Vite environment variables.
#
# Local `npm run dev` uses the built-in loopback defaults:
#   RPC          http://127.0.0.1:8899
#   WebSocket    ws://127.0.0.1:8900
#   Explorer API http://127.0.0.1:8088
#   Explorer UI  http://127.0.0.1:4000
#
# Deployed and remote-preview endpoints belong only in:
#   docker/env.public.example
#
# Containers receive those canonical AEKO_* values at runtime and
# docker/explorer-ui-entrypoint.sh writes them to /runtime-config.js.
